s=s.replace('provenance:\n  statement: ai-altered\n  proof: not-applicable','provenance:\n  statement: ai-altered\n  proof: ai-altered\nproof_strategy: direct')
s=s.replace('thm-standard-basis-of-the-generic-type-a-hecke-algebra]', 'thm-standard-basis-of-the-generic-type-a-hecke-algebra, thm-murphy-tableau-elements-form-a-cellular-basis, lem-type-a-hecke-permutation-modules-have-semistandard-murphy-bases-and-specht-filtrations, thm-nonzero-cell-heads-classify-the-simple-modules-of-a-cellular-algebra, lem-finite-cellular-nonzero-form-heads-purity-and-shared-factor-linkage]')
s=s.replace('  precheck: n/a','  precheck: pass')
s=s.replace('the set of compositions $\\mu=(\\mu_1,\\dots,\\mu_d)$ of $n$ (so $\\mu_i\\in\\mathbb N$ and $\\sum_i\\mu_i=n$)', 'the set of weak compositions $\\mu=(\\mu_1,\\dots,\\mu_d)$ of $n$ (so $\\mu_i\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$ and $\\sum_i\\mu_i=n$; zero parts are allowed and give empty rows)')
s=s.replace('The semistandard intersection-basis theorem gives exactly these maps as the Hom basis;', 'The integral intersection and Hom construction below proves that these are exactly the Hom basis;')
